            </li>
            <li>
              For the most promising candidate, what is the <strong>business success
              metric</strong>, in addition to the technical accuracy metric?
            </li>
            <li>
              For this candidate, does the case fall into a <strong>'high-risk'</strong> category
              under the EU AI Act (HR, credit, healthcare, justice, public services)? If so,
